    {
        "content": "<p>AFAICT the induction proof can live in <code>Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic</code>, the <code>by_cases</code> proof can live in <code>Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Ring.Finset</code>, but the <code>qify</code> proof requires creating a new file (or putting it in something far like <code>Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Algebra.Basic</code>)</p>",
        "id": 594553334,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
